# ============================================================
# Multi-universe DAG: 4 (mbh, nucleation) scenarios x 2 occupation methods x 100 universes each, run independently.
# Occupation methods swept: uniform, varying
# ALL 800 (scenario x occupation x universe) realizations run in parallel and feed into ONE combined REPORT_UNIVERSES job.
# PREPARE_DATA_FOR_INFERENCE jobs run AFTER REPORT_UNIVERSES (they consume its max_detected_*.h5 output), not in parallel with it.
# Total jobs: 8 x 100 x 6 + 1 (single combined report) + 8 (prepare-for-inference) = 4809
# ============================================================

